@sabotage
title: Sabotage the fabs
subtitle: Hurt Brazos prosperity
choose-if: worker_actions_remaining > 0 or month_actions_remaining > 0
unavailable-subtitle: [! if worker_actions_remaining > 0: No worker actions left ?][! if month_actions_remaining > 0: No generic actions left ?]No organizing actions left this month.
on-arrival: {!
Q.spendWorkerActionWithFallback();
Q.prosperity_brazos = Math.max(0, (Number(Q.prosperity_brazos) || 0) - 0.5);
if (typeof Q.syncProsperityDisplays === 'function') { Q.syncProsperityDisplays() }
!}

Shift swaps and quiet refusals.

@mutual_aid
title: Mutual aid in the fabs
subtitle: Help Limelight drone prosperity
choose-if: worker_actions_remaining > 0 or month_actions_remaining > 0
unavailable-subtitle: [! if worker_actions_remaining > 0: No worker actions left ?][! if month_actions_remaining > 0: No generic actions left ?]No organizing actions left this month.
on-arrival: {!
Q.spendWorkerActionWithFallback();
if (typeof Q.bumpBlockProsperity === 'function') { Q.bumpBlockProsperity('Limelight', 'drone', 0.05); }
if (typeof Q.syncProsperityDisplays === 'function') { Q.syncProsperityDisplays() }
!}

Med-kit pools and rent bridges.

@stealth_canvas
title: Stealth canvas
subtitle: Limelight canvas
choose-if: worker_actions_remaining > 0 or month_actions_remaining > 0
unavailable-subtitle: [! if worker_actions_remaining > 0: No worker actions left ?][! if month_actions_remaining > 0: No generic actions left ?]No organizing actions left this month.
on-arrival: {!
Q.spendWorkerActionWithFallback();
Q.workers_canvas_limelight += 1;
if (typeof Q.update_projections === 'function') { Q.update_projections() }
!}

